      "kind": "formula",
      "text": "2:1：Y=I0·S′+I1·S；4:1：Y=S1′S0′I0+S1′S0I1+S1S0′I2+S1S0I3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "condition",
      "text": "S=0 输出 I0，S=1 输出 I1（2:1）"
    }
  ],
