          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "RB-KU-055-example",
        "kind": "example",
        "role": "material",
        "payload": {
          "title": "例题 · 选择码为 01 时的输出",
          "problem": "沿用交互图的接线 I0=z、I1=¬z、I2=0、I3=1，求 S1S0=01 时的输出。",
          "answerNature": "authored-example"
        },
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "SRC-C05",
            "versionId": "VER-SRC-C05-ad2a56210ce2",
            "pdfPages": [
              11
            ],
            "visualStatus": "verified",
            "note": "4:1 MUX 位序、功能表和表达式"
          }
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "RB-KU-055-example-solution",
            "kind": "steps",
            "role": "material",
            "payload": {
              "items": [
                "选择码按普通二进制排列，01 对应编号 1 的通道，因此 Y=I1。",
                "I1 接 ¬z，所以 Y=¬z。",
                "z=0 时输出 1；z=1 时输出 0。其余数据端不影响本次输出。"
              ]
            },
            "sourceRefs": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "RB-KU-055-practice",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "role": "material",
        "payload": {
          "title": "练习 · 换一个选择码",
          "problem": "保持相同接线，令 S1S0=10，分别取 z=0 和 z=1，输出是否变化？",
          "hint": "先确定 10 选中的数据端，再看它接的是变量还是固定电平。",
          "answerNature": "self-test"
        },
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "RB-KU-055-practice-answer",
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "role": "material",
            "payload": {
              "text": "10 选中 I2，而 I2 固定为 0，所以两种情况的输出都为 0。未选中数据端 z 的变化不会影响当前输出。"
            },
            "sourceRefs": []
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
